{"id": "t161-002", "text": "Ravi and his wife Ana are viewing a two-bed in Walthamstow on Saturday at 11. They're hoping to put an offer in the same day if it's any good. Ana is keen on it because it's near her work, but Ravi thinks the second bedroom is basically a cupboard. They've already lost two places this month to cash buyers, so they're both a bit fed up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing a two-bed in Walthamstow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same day", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this month"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit fed up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t161-007", "text": "Suzanne is vegetarian and doesn't drink coffee, only green tea.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink coffee, only green tea", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t161-008", "text": "Olivia said she'd love a decent cast iron pan. Hers cracked in the move.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a decent cast iron pan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t161-013", "text": "Kenji's cat Miso went missing on Tuesday. He found her the next day hiding in the neighbour's shed, very pleased with herself.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Miso", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "neighbour", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t161-016", "text": "Tomás said he might come and visit soon, possibly around half term. Nothing firm yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "come and visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "around half term", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t161-021", "text": "Rana called. Her dad passed away on Sunday and the funeral is next Thursday at 1pm. I need to send flowers the day before and ask whether she wants company afterwards. Her brother is flying back from Toronto on Tuesday to help sort things out, and she's staying at her mum's for the rest of the week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday at 1pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask whether she wants company", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Toronto", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the rest of the week"}]}
{"id": "t161-026", "text": "Zeynep's sister is getting married in Izmir in May. Zeynep and Mehmet are flying out a week before to help set up. Mehmet is giving a speech at the reception and is already panicking about it. They're staying on for a few days afterwards and might visit his cousins in Ankara.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Izmir", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech at the reception", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousins", "owner": "p3"}]}
{"id": "t161-027", "text": "Mehmet said the move to the new house went fine, apart from the van turning up two hours late. Their kids love having a garden.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move to the new house", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love having a garden", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t161-029", "text": "Heather says the new flat is lovely but the neighbours are loud. She's been sleeping badly since the move.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Heather", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "neighbours", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "loud", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sleeping badly", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the move"}]}
{"id": "t161-033", "text": "Yaw's mum is in hospital for tests. He's going up to see her on Saturday morning. I should ring him on Sunday to see how she is. He's trying not to worry, but the doctors haven't told them much and his sister is meant to be travelling that weekend, so it's mostly falling on him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yaw", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tests", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going up to see her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying not to worry", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "travelling", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t161-034", "text": "Lunch with Francesca and Julia today. Francesca is finally leaving the agency at Christmas and going freelance in the new year. Julia has been offered a place on the teaching course in Sheffield starting in September, so she'll be moving up sometime over the summer. We talked about a weekend away before she goes, maybe in June. Need to sort dates with both of them soon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d0", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going freelance", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered a place", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "teaching course in Sheffield", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving up", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime over the summer", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "EVENT", "text": "weekend away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she goes", "anchor": "e6"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June", "anchor": "e6"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort dates with both of them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e6", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t161-036", "text": "Olivia wants to meet up sometime after her exams. Remind me to message her in a couple of weeks.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meet up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "exams", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a couple of weeks", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t161-037", "text": "Beatriz and her husband are viewing houses in Bath on Saturday. Three viewings, the first at 10am and the last one at 4, with lunch somewhere in between.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Beatriz", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing houses in Bath", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "4", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "somewhere in between", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t161-043", "text": "Siddharth (Sid) is a structural engineer and is obsessed with old Saabs. He has two in his garage and neither of them runs.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sid", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "structural engineer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old Saabs", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "has two in his garage and neither of them runs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t161-044", "text": "Matilda rang about the house move. Completion has slipped again and is now pencilled in for the 19th, although the solicitor says it could be the week after. If it does happen on the 19th, she'd like me to take the kids that morning so she can deal with the removal men. I'll pick them up at 8 and drop them back after tea. Remind me to check with her on the 17th whether it's still going ahead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "house move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Completion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 19th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "solicitor", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 19th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "8", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "after tea", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 17th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t161-045", "text": "Tomás's band is playing at the Lexington on Friday at 9pm. He said the new drummer is still finding his feet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "band", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playing at the Lexington", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 9pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "drummer", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t161-051", "text": "Rana mentioned she'd like to visit sometime in the spring, possibly with her cousin.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t161-054", "text": "Barbara Walsh, my old landlady, still sends a card every Christmas. She lives in Galway now and keeps hens.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara Walsh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "old landlady", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sends a card", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Christmas"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Galway", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "hens", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t161-055", "text": "Antoine and Svetlana came round for dinner. Antoine has a second interview in Lyon on the 6th at 2pm, and if he gets it they'll move over in the new year. Svetlana is less keen and is worried about finding work there. Remind me to message Antoine the day after the interview, and ask Svetlana over for coffee soon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second interview in Lyon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 6th at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move over", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "less keen", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about finding work there", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Antoine", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after the interview", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Svetlana over for coffee", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t161-060", "text": "Kenji is calling me on Sunday at 7pm his time, which is 11am here. Must actually be awake for it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "calling me", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 7pm his time", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "11am here", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "be awake for it", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
